@startuml component-building-blocks
!include style.puml
title TyPy building blocks and their allowed dependencies
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45

component "typy-cli" as Cli
component "typy-driver" as Driver
component "typy-source" as Source
component "typy-check" as Check
component "typy-tyir" as Tyir
component "typy-lower" as Lower
component "typy-codegen" as Codegen
component "typy-build" as Build
component "typy-diagnostics" as Diagnostics <<shared kernel>>
component "typy-stdlib" as Stdlib
component "typy-runtime" as Runtime <<no_std>>
component "typy-conformance" as Conformance <<test tool>>

component "ruff_python_parser" as Ruff <<external>>
component "inkwell and LLVM 23" as Inkwell <<external>>

Cli --> Driver
Driver --> Source
Driver --> Check
Driver --> Lower
Driver --> Codegen
Driver --> Build
Source --> Ruff
Source --> Stdlib
Check --> Source
Lower --> Check
Lower --> Tyir
Codegen --> Tyir
Codegen --> Inkwell
Build ..> Runtime : links the built archive
Source --> Diagnostics
Check --> Diagnostics

note bottom of Diagnostics
  Every compiler crate may depend on
  typy-diagnostics; the arrows from
  typy-tyir, typy-lower, typy-codegen,
  typy-build and typy-driver are left out.
end note
Conformance --> Driver
@enduml
